WEBVTT

00:02:57.215 --> 00:03:00.426
See, that's what I wanted to do.

00:03:02.136 --> 00:03:05.473
The egotistical part of me
wanted to say,

00:03:05.514 --> 00:03:07.642
“What do you mean,
you don’t like innovation?

00:03:07.642 --> 00:03:11.229
You don't want to improve the working
quality for health care professionals,

00:03:11.229 --> 00:03:13.231
which, in turn,
will improve patient care?”

00:03:13.731 --> 00:03:16.067
Well, I didn't say that, obviously.

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:19.820
Instead, I asked her one simple question.

00:03:19.862 --> 00:03:20.988
And that was:

00:03:23.199 --> 00:03:24.367
"Why?"

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:29.872
And what she told me
gave me the biggest light-bulb moment.